{"passive":{"name":"The Hitman and the Seer","description":"Aphelios wields 5 Lunari Weapons made by his sister Alune. He has access to two at a time: one main-hand and one off-hand. Each weapon has a unique Basic Attack and Ability. Attacks and abilities consume a weapon's ammo. When out of ammo, Aphelios discards the weapon and Alune summons the next of the 5."},"primaryAbilities":[{"slot":"Q","name":"Weapon Abilites","enginePath":"Characters/Aphelios/Spells/ApheliosQ_ClientTooltipWrapper","maxRank":6,"description":"Aphelios has 5 different activated abilities, based on his main-hand weapon:\n\nCalibrum (Rifle): Long range shot that marks its target for a long-range follow-up attack.\nSeverum (Scythe Pistol): Run fast while attacking nearby enemies with both weapons.\nGravitum (Cannon): Root all enemies slowed by this weapon.\nInfernum (Flamethrower): Blast enemies in a cone and attack them with your off-hand weapon.\nCrescendum (Chakram): Deploy a sentry that shoots your off-hand weapon.","tooltipTemplate":"{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[9,9,9,9,9,9],"costByRank":[60,60,60,60,60,60],"rangeByRank":[1450,1450,1450,1450,1450,1450],"resourceTemplate":"{{ cost }} {{ abilityresourcename }}"},{"slot":"W","name":"Phase","enginePath":"Characters/Aphelios/Spells/ApheliosWAbility/ApheliosW","maxRank":6,"description":"Aphelios swaps his main-hand gun with his off-hand gun, replacing his basic attack and activated ability.","tooltipTemplate":"Swap main-hand and off-hand weapons, equipping <b><i><span class=\"colora64dff\">Gravitum</span></i></b>.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[0.8,0.8,0.8,0.8,0.8,0.8],"costByRank":[0,0,0,0,0,0],"rangeByRank":[250,250,250,250,250,250],"resourceTemplate":"No Cost"},{"slot":"E","name":"Weapon Queue System","enginePath":"Characters/Aphelios/Spells/ApheliosE_ClientTooltipWrapper","maxRank":6,"description":"Aphelios has no third ability. This slot shows the next weapon Alune will give him. Weapon ord